+        "receipt time minus the venue's own trade timestamp) for every TRADE event carrying a "
+        "`venue_ts`. **BOOK events carry no `venue_ts` field at all** — this reader states no "
+        "book receipt-lag number anywhere; the honest statement is a MEASURED BOUND, this trade "
