+    `n > 1` because it measures REPEAT frames — correctly, and it is untouched. But the as-of top
+    did not change for that whole stretch, which is exactly what the 2b detector is denominated
+    in. On a venue without a keepalive this is the ONLY shape a frozen top can take.
+
+    RED at the run-51 base: `outside_book_runs` was built from `stale_runs`, so this produced NO
+    run at all — `assert [] != []` — and on an undeclared capture like this one it could not have
+    produced one anyway (BLOCKER 3).
