+def test_the_real_capture_silence_shape_PUBLISHES_with_its_straddlers_dropped(tmp_path):
+    """BLOCKER 4's decisive case, in the shape the orchestrator measured on the real capture: a
+    few FLAGGED frozen runs out of many, silence around 0.1% of accounted time, worst interval far
+    under the gap-detect threshold.
+
+    RED at the run-51 base: `unexplained_silence_defect_signals` `any()`-ed the flagged runs over
+    the whole pair, so the pair was EXCLUDED and the probe published nothing —
+    `assert 'BTC/USD' not in {'BTC/USD': 'unexplained book silence [D77 DEFECT-SIGNAL GATE
+    FIRED]: ...'}`. That is the outcome D77 was ruled to end, reached through the gate D77
+    installed.
